msgstr "Exactly one of ``signatureHeader`` and ``signatureBodyField`` must be set. The signature is written as a lowercase hexadecimal string."

#: ../../../../../../../Users/antivanov/Documents/workspace-ctk/ecos-docs/docs/integration/Camel_DSL/processors.rst:830
