"``поле=значение``, ``\"поле\": \"значение\"`` и ``{поле=значение}``, а также "
"в заголовке авторизации"
msgstr "Field names as a comma-separated string. The field value is hidden in three forms: ``field=value``, ``\"field\": \"value\"``, and ``{field=value}``, as well as in the authorization header"

#: ../../../../../../../Users/antivanov/Documents/workspace-ctk/ecos-docs/docs/integration/Camel_DSL/processors.rst:854
